35042735043}], [{"text": "Example 5", "x0": 0.04945054945054945, "y0": 0.029526029526029528, "x1": 0.12417582417582418, "y1": 0.04040404040404041}, {"text": "A worker plans to invests $10 000 into a superannuation scheme on the 1st July each year. Their account", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.03885003885003885, "x1": 0.8373626373626374, "y1": 0.06293706293706294}, {"text": "pays 8%pa", "x0": 0.8428571428571429, "y0": 0.046620046620046623, "x1": 0.9197802197802197, "y1": 0.057498057498057496}, {"text": "compounding annually.", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.06371406371406371, "x1": 0.21868131868131868, "y1": 0.07459207459207459}, {"text": "a) How much money will be in the account after 20 years?", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.08003108003108003, "x1": 0.5241758241758242, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "b) What annual instalment would have produced $1 000 000 in the same time period?", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.09013209013209013, "x1": 0.734065934065934, "y1": 0.11421911421911422}], [{"text": "Example 6", "x0": 0.04945054945054945, "y0": 0.029526029526029528, "x1": 0.12417582417582418, "y1": 0.04040404040404041}, {"text": "Charmaine has a superannuation scheme with monthly instalments of $600 for 10 years and an interest", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.04584304584304584, "x1": 0.8241758241758241, "y1": 0.057498057498057496}, {"text": "rate of", "x0": 0.8307692307692308, "y0": 0.04584304584304584, "x1": 0.8791208791208791, "y1": 0.05516705516705517}, {"text": "7.8% p.a., compounded monthly. What will the final value of her investment be?", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.055944055944055944, "x1": 0.6505494505494506, "y1": 0.08003108003108003}, {"text": "a) Charmaine was offered an alternative scheme with interest of 7.8% pa, compounded weekly,", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.08003108003108003, "x1": 0.8043956043956044, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "and weekly", "x0": 0.810989010989011, "y0": 0.08080808080808081, "x1": 0.8945054945054945, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "instalments. What weekly instalments would have yielded the same final value as the scheme", "x0": 0.1087912087912088, "y0": 0.09712509712509712, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.10878010878010878}, {"text": "in part a?", "x0": 0.8153846153846154, "y0": 0.0979020979020979, "x1": 0.8846153846153846, "y1": 0.10878010878010878}, {"text": "b) Which scheme would have cost her more per year?", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.11421911421911422, "x1": 0.49230769230769234, "y1": 0.1258741258741259}], [{"text": "8E Examples", "x0": 0.4472527472527473, "y0": 0.029526029526029528, "x1": 0.5406593406593406, "y1": 0.04040404040404041}, {"text": "Example 1", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.06371406371406371, "x1": 0.12527472527472527, "y1": 0.07459207459207459}, {"text": "Yianni and Eleni borrow $20 000 from the Town and Country Bank to go on a trip to Constantinople.", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.08003108003108003, "x1": 0.7956043956043956, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "Interest is", "x0": 0.8021978021978022, "y0": 0.08080808080808081, "x1": 0.8747252747252747, "y1": 0.08935508935508936}, {"text": "charged at 12% per annum, compounded monthly. They start repaying the loan one month after taking", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.09712509712509712, "x1": 0.8219780219780219, "y1": 0.10878010878010878}, {"text": "it out, and", "x0": 0.8274725274725274, "y0": 0.0979020979020979, "x1": 0.9021978021978022, "y1": 0.108003108003108}, {"text": "their monthly instalments are $300.", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.11421911421911422, "x1": 0.3153846153846154, "y1": 0.1258741258741259}, {"text": "a) How much will they still owe the bank at the end of six years?", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.12432012432012432, "x1": 0.5692307692307692, "y1": 0.14840714840714841}, {"text": "b) How much interest will they have paid in these six years?", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.14918414918414918, "x1": 0.5351648351648352, "y1": 0.16083916083916083}], [{"text": "Example 2", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.029526029526029528, "x1": 0.12637362637362637, "y1": 0.04040404040404041}, {"text": "A couple borrow $500 000 to purchase a new home. They are to repay monthly. The interest rate", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.04584304584304584, "x1": 0.7846153846153846, "y1": 0.057498057498057496}, {"text": "is 6%pa,", "x0": 0.7912087912087912, "y0": 0.046620046620046623, "x1": 0.8494505494505494, "y1": 0.057498057498057496}, {"text": "compounded monthly.", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.06371406371406371, "x1": 0.2175824175824176, "y1": 0.07459207459207459}, {"text": "Find the monthly repayment if the term of the loan is 25 years.", "x0": 0.04945054945054945, "y0": 0.08003108003108003, "x1": 0.5131868131868131, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}], [{"text": "Example 3", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.029526029526029528, "x1": 0.12637362637362637, "y1": 0.04040404040404041}, {"text": "Georgia borrows $5000 and agrees to make repayments of $100 at the end of each month, calculated", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.03885003885003885, "x1": 0.8098901098901099, "y1": 0.06293706293706294}, {"text": "from the date of", "x0": 0.8153846153846154, "y0": 0.04584304584304584, "x1": 0.9384615384615385, "y1": 0.05516705516705517}, {"text": "the loan. Interest is charged on the unpaid debt at 1.5% per month.", "x0": 0.04835164835164835, "y0": 0.06371406371406371, "x1": 0.5472527472527473, "y1": 0.07459207459207459}, {"text": "a) How much does Georgia still owe after the eighth repayment?", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.08003108003108003, "x1": 0.5736263736263736, "y1": 0.09168609168609168}, {"text": "b) How much time will it take to pay of the loan?", "x0": 0.07912087912087912, "y0": 0.09712509712509712, "x1": 0.45274725274725275, "y1": 0.10878010878010878}, {"text": "If Georgia doubles the repayments, how much time will it take to pay off the loan?", "x0": 0.10989010989010989, "y0": 0